It would make sense to have this as a core feature because it's already there, it just need a bit more work before you can make some really cool text effects. This would also make creating fonts a lot easier for beginners as they can just play with the DynamicFont instead of spending many hours in Photoshop and Shoebox to make a simple Bitmap font. 

